        ; INT. 18
            1: Frog
            : CMP. DONE
            : DSC. Jump extremely high to reach elevated areas.
            2: Spark Pylon
            : CMP. DONE
            : DSC. Zip along power lines to traverse across levels.
            3: Paragoomba
            : CMP. DONE
            : DSC. Fly over gaps and hazards.
            4: Chain Chomp
            : CMP. DONE
            : DSC. Swing and break obstacles with momentum.
            5: Big Chain Chomp
            : CMP. DONE
            : DSC. Same as Chain Chomp, with longer reach.
            6: Chain Chompikins
            : CMP. DONE
            : DSC. Used in the fight with Madame Broode.
            7: T-Rex
            : CMP. DONE
            : DSC. Smash through rocks and enemies (temporary).
            8: Binoculars
            : CMP. DONE
            : DSC. Look around and survey the surrounding area.
            9: Bullet Bill
            : CMP. DONE
            : DSC. Fly quickly to destroy blocks (temporary).
            10: Moe-Eye
            : CMP. DONE
            : DSC. See invisible platforms and objects with its shades.
            11: Cactus
            : CMP. DONE
            : DSC. Move blocked areas to reveal hidden Power Moons.
            12: Goomba
            : CMP. DONE
            : DSC. Stack into towers; unlock affection-based Moon.
            13: Knucklotec’s Fist
            : CMP. DONE
            : DSC. Punch enemies during boss fight with Knucklotec.
            14: Mini Rocket
            : CMP. DONE
            : DSC. Fly to sky-platform areas to find moons.
            15: Glydon
            : CMP. DONE
            : DSC. Glide across long distances.
            16: Lakitu
            : CMP. DONE
            : DSC. Fish for Cheep Cheeps and capture Big Cheep Cheeps.
            17: Zipper
            : CMP. DONE
            : DSC. Open hidden paths by unzipping sections of levels.
            18: Cheep Cheep
            : CMP. DONE
            : DSC. Swim faster; breathe underwater.
            19: Puzzle Part (Lake Kingdom)
            : CMP. DONE
            : DSC. Solve a Lochlady puzzle to earn a Power Moon.
            20: Poison Piranha Plant
            : CMP. DONE
            : DSC. Spit poison to clear enemies (post rock-throw).
            21: Uproot
            : CMP. DONE
            : DSC. Stretch and break high Rock Blocks.
            22: Fire Bro
            : CMP. DONE
            : DSC. Throw fire balls to defeat obstacles and enemies.
            23: Sherm
            : CMP. DONE
            : DSC. Drive and destroy barriers as a tank.
            24: Coin Coffer
            : CMP. DONE
            : DSC. Shoot coins to attack and solve puzzles.
            25: Tree
            : CMP. DONE
            : DSC. Move it to reveal secret ground spots.
            26: Boulder
            : CMP. DONE
            : DSC. Shift rocks to clear paths or access areas.
            27: Picture Match Part (Goomba)
            : CMP. TODO
            : DSC. Collect Goomba puzzle piece in Cloud Kingdom.
            28: Tropical Wiggler
            : CMP. DONE
            : DSC. Stretch onto small platforms and alcoves.
            29: Pole
            : CMP. DONE
            : DSC. Propel Mario long distances in Metro Kingdom.
            30: Manhole Extension
            : CMP. DONE
            : DSC. Lift a manhole to reveal hidden Power Moons.
            31: Taxi
            : CMP. DONE
            : DSC. Fly to secret night zone to gather Moon Shards.
            32: R.C. Car
            : CMP. DONE
            : DSC. Drive to break into a cage and collect moons.
            33: Ty-Foo
